From 7df2071efb28a829ad9416565507541f073d459f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:09:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] One UI look for the phone (Galaxy S10+ port)

Main list: large centred title that gives way to a small bar on scroll,
account card (KUser) opening the users module, one rounded card per
category on a black page, coloured circles with white Breeze glyphs mapped
by module, separators inset to the label, floating search pill with the
list fading out under it. Subcategory pages: large title with a back
arrow, text rows in one card. Module pages: black header without a line.

The application loads the One UI Dark colour scheme (color-schemes/
OneUiDark.colors) for itself only, through KDE_COLOR_SCHEME_PATH and the
palette, so the module pages get the black page and #171719 cards.

Polish strings for "Search", "Clear", "User account".

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
